# .assetignore — patterns asset-processing tooling should skip.
# Distinct from .gitignore: this file documents intent for any future asset
# pipeline (texture/audio optimization, bundling, scanning) even though no
# such tooling is wired up yet in this project. See docs/BUILD.md.

# Large SoundFont binaries — referenced by path in MIDI settings, never bundled/optimized.
assets/soundfonts/*.sf2
assets/soundfonts/*.sf3

# Generated export output — not source assets, shouldn't be scanned/optimized.
publish/
/examples/*.musicxml.bak

# Build/debug artifacts — never asset-pipeline input.
*.binlog
bin/
obj/
